gui.friends.notice.short = Too short: type at least two letters.
gui.friends.notice.searching = Looking for {n}…
gui.friends.notice.notFound = No account named «{n}» turned up. You can still send the request — it waits for them to log in — or add them as an offline friend.
gui.friends.notice.searchFailed = Could not check the nick: the site did not answer. The request can still be sent.
gui.friends.notice.sent = Request sent to {n}. You become friends once they add you back.
gui.friends.notice.queued = The request for {n} is saved and will go out as soon as they are in the cloud.
gui.friends.notice.addedLocal = {n} added as a local friend and sits under "Offline" below.
