gui.friends.reconnect.value = to the node
gui.friends.reconnect.desc = Brings the connection back up without waiting for the next retry.
gui.friends.status = Status
gui.friends.status.desc = Whether the cloud sees this friend right now.
gui.friends.playingOn = Playing on
gui.friends.playingOn.desc = The server your friend is playing on.
gui.friends.onlineFor = Online for
gui.friends.onlineFor.desc = Counted from the moment your client saw them in the cloud.
gui.friends.lastSeen = Last seen
gui.friends.lastSeen.desc = When your client last saw them. While you are offline the friends are invisible and this clock does not run.
