module.ahhelper.description = Scans the auction house and finds items below market price. It tells you what is worth reselling.
module.aimassist.description = Gently nudges your crosshair toward the target while you still aim yourself. Looks like normal aiming, not a robot behind your back.
module.airsuck.description = Freezes you in mid-air and cancels the fall. Handy to wait out a moment or hang over a cliff.
module.ambientparticles.description = Adds your own particles to the world: dust, sparks, fireflies. Pure looks, no effect on gameplay.
module.ancientfarm.description = Farms ancient debris in the nether along a route. It digs, collects and comes back on its own.
module.antibot.description = Filters out bots and fake players so your aura does not waste hits on dummies. Handy on servers that spawn bots on purpose.
module.antiinvisible.description = Reveals invisible players and mobs. Hiding under a potion next to you stops working.
module.applefarm.description = Farms apples down a priority chain: the best first, leftovers after. You just watch the food pile up.
module.arrows.description = Draws the path of arrows and projectiles. You see where it lands before you shoot.
module.aura.description = Hits everyone in range: targets, rotations, crits and cooldown are tuned down to the smallest detail. The main combat module of the client.
module.autoaccept.description = Accepts teleport, clan and duel invites for you. Pick who to accept from so nobody drags you around.
module.autoauth.description = Types your login password on join. The password lives in the config, so you never type it again.
module.autocapcha.description = Solves server captchas through Zenith Cloud. Handy on anarchy servers that throw a captcha on every join.
module.autocraft.description = Crafts from recorded presets: one bind and the item is done. It remembers the slot layout for you.
module.autoduels.description = Runs duels in a loop: accepts the challenge, fights, looks for the next one. Stat farming without you.
module.autoelytraarmor.description = Swaps your chestplate for elytra and back automatically. Take off and it is elytra, land and it is armor.
module.autoexplosion.description = Places and pops crystals or beds on the target for you. It counts the damage so you do not blow yourself up along with the enemy.
module.autoinventory.description = Buys whatever the set is missing straight off the auction house. The set itself is built in the Tools tab.
module.autoleave.description = Disconnects you on your own conditions: low health, no totems, enemies nearby. Better to leave than to hand over your gear.
module.autoloot.description = Picks up and sorts loot after a fight. Valuables to your inventory, junk stays behind.
module.automine.description = Mines a chosen ore or tunnel without you. It avoids hazards and returns when the inventory is full.
module.autopay.description = Sends money automatically by the rules you set. Handy for trades and clan collections.
module.autopotionbrewing.description = Brews potions in sequence: loads ingredients and takes the result. Set the recipe once and it carries on.
module.autorespawn.description = Presses respawn right after you die. No more staring at the grey screen.
module.autosbor.description = Builds your inventory for the server: buys, sorts and enchants. A ready kit instead of an hour of shopping.
module.autosprint.description = Keeps sprinting on at all times, even after a hit or a meal. No more holding the key down.
module.autoswap.description = Swaps items in your hands to fit the moment: sword for axe, crystal for totem. It decides what you need right now.
module.autotool.description = Puts the best tool for the block in your hand before the hit. You dig faster and stop grinding your sword on stone.
module.autototem.description = Keeps a totem in your offhand and puts a new one back right after it pops. You choose the health threshold to grab it at.
module.autouse.description = Uses the chosen item by itself: food, potions, snowballs. It fires on conditions, not blindly.
module.autowarden.description = Farms wardens: keeps distance, hits in the window and avoids dead ends. It clears the chests after the fight too.
module.botautocapcha.description = Solves the map captcha for a bot - Zenith Cloud reads the picture.
module.botautomine.description = Ore farming by a bot: it finds a vein, mines it and moves on to the next.
module.botwarpfarm.description = The bot farms the same anarchy the main WarpFarm found, and waits for a new one if the main leaves.
module.autoweb.description = Throws cobwebs under the target to bog them down. Pairs well with aura and traps.
module.autozamok.description = Walks the castle through Baritone and clears it out. It plans the route and the loot itself.
module.backtrack.description = Keeps the target in its past position and hits where it used to be. Reaches people who already ran around the corner.
module.basefinder.description = Looks for other players' bases by loaded chunks and building traces. It marks finds so you can come back later.
module.betterminecraft.description = A set of small fixes to vanilla visuals and interface. Trivial one by one, noticeably nicer together.
module.blink.description = Holds your outgoing packets and releases them all at once when you turn it off. The server sees you standing still while you are already gone.
module.blockesp.description = Highlights chosen blocks through walls. Ores, chests or portals are visible from afar.
module.boathighjump.description = Launches your boat upward while slipping past anticheat checks. A way up to places you cannot climb on foot.
module.boatlongjump.description = Throws your boat into a long forward jump. You fly over what everyone else drives around.
module.boatfly.description = Your boat glides perfectly level without losing height. WASD steers relative to the camera.
module.boatfly.speed = Speed
module.boatfly.speed.desc = Horizontal speed in blocks per second
module.boatfly.vertical = Vertical
module.boatfly.vertical.desc = Space goes up, sprint key goes down. Off keeps the height fixed
module.boatfly.verticalSpeed = Vertical speed
module.boatfly.verticalSpeed.desc = Climb and descent speed in blocks per second
module.boatfly.mode = Mode
module.boatfly.mode.desc = Grim ignores server boat setbacks and re-enters the boat if kicked out. Vanilla just flies
module.boatfly.mode.grim = Grim
module.boatfly.mode.vanilla = Vanilla
module.boatfly.remount = Remount
module.boatfly.remount.desc = Get back into the boat right away if the anticheat dismounts you
module.boatfly.antiKick = Anti-kick
module.boatfly.antiKick.desc = Every 2 seconds dips the boat by 0.04 for one tick so the server does not kick for floating
module.boatfly.debug = Debug
module.boatfly.debug.desc = Print ignored setbacks and dismounts to chat
module.bot.description = Runs headless bots and controls them from the client. Farming, guarding, a second pair of hands, your call.
module.bowaimbot.description = Aims your bow and crossbow at the target, correcting for arrow drop and target movement. Shoot as usual, it does the math.
module.cameratweaks.description = Tunes the camera: angle, distance, smoothing and third person view. Small things that add up to a comfortable view.
module.chams.description = Draws players through walls as colored silhouettes. You see who is where even behind blocks.
module.cheststealer.description = Empties a chest fast. Set a filter to grab only what you actually need.
module.clanupgrade.description = Upgrades your clan automatically: invests resources and clicks the upgrades. The clan grows while you do other things.
module.clickaction.description = Binds actions to clicks on a player: friend them, mark as staff, open the profile. Saves you chat commands.
module.cloudwaypoints.description = Places waypoints and shares them through the cloud. Your friends see the same points you do.
module.containerhelper.description = Helps with chests and shulkers: quick moving, sorting, auto close. Fewer clicks in the interface.
module.criticals.description = Turns your hits into crits without jumping by faking tiny vertical moves. More damage from the same number of swings.
module.crystaloptimizer.description = Calculates crystal damage and picks the best spots. More damage to them, less to you.
module.debug.description = Logs packets and events with timestamps. For when something breaks and you want to know why.
module.elytrabooster.description = Boosts your elytra without fireworks by adding speed in flight. You go further off the same launch.
module.elytrafly.description = Smooth elytra flight without dips and jerks, with bypasses for popular anarchy servers. It holds altitude for you.
module.elytrahelper.description = Watches your elytra in flight: repairs, swaps and warns about durability. It will not let you drop from broken wings.
module.elytramotion.description = Tweaks flight physics: acceleration, inertia and turning. Fine tuning on top of plain elytra.
module.elytratarget.description = Flies your elytra to a chosen point or player. It holds the course while you watch your surroundings.
module.emotes.description = An emote wheel with animations and auto third person. Pure fun, but a nice one.
module.entityesp.description = Boxes players and mobs through walls. The client's main ESP with every rendering mode.
module.eventtracker.description = Catches server events and announces them. You will not miss a giveaway or a warp start.
module.fakelag.description = Delays your packets near a target so the enemy sees you late. A classic way to break someone else's aim.
module.fakeplayer.description = Spawns a dummy player next to you for testing. Handy to check aura, ESP and combat settings.
module.fastbreak.description = Breaks blocks faster than vanilla. Tunnels go noticeably quicker.
module.fireworkesp.description = Highlights fireworks in the air. You see who is flying on elytra and from where.
module.flybypass.description = Flight tuned to specific server checks: it shapes the motion so you do not get flagged. Speed and mode are adjustable.
module.freecam.description = Lets the camera fly away from your body. Scout a cave or peek behind a wall without moving.
module.grimglide.description = Glides just above the ground past Grim checks. No jumps, no falls, you simply slide forward.
module.guiwalk.description = Lets you walk and turn the camera with a menu or chest open. Sort your inventory while running.
module.handfire.description = Removes the fire overlay when you burn. You see where to run instead of an orange wall.
module.hitparticles.description = Shows particles on hit. You instantly know whether the hit landed.
module.interface.description = The client look and HUD elements: theme, colors, what to show on screen. Everything visual lives here.
module.inventorysetting.description = Global inventory rules: what goes where, what to drop, what to repair with. Set it once and it works everywhere.
module.itemdebug.description = Dumps the full item data to console on click. A tool for digging into server items, not for fighting.
module.selfflag.description = Self-detection meter: scores your attacks against anticheat signatures — snap, spin, rhythm, reach.
module.selfFlag.overlay = Overlay
module.selfFlag.warn = Warn
module.selfFlag.x = X
module.selfFlag.y = Y
module.actionmap.description = Logs every outgoing packet with a timestamp — action-to-packet map for detection analysis.
module.anticheatprobe.description = Anticheat packet timing: ping transactions, position corrections, correlation with our actions.
module.commandprobe.description = Walks the server command tree and collects argument suggestions without running commands.
module.commandProbe.tree = Command tree
module.commandProbe.completions = Completions
module.commandProbe.depth = Depth
module.commandProbe.depth.desc = Argument levels to walk
module.commandProbe.delay = Delay
module.commandProbe.delay.desc = Pause between requests
module.packetaudit.description = Census of incoming packets plus scoreboard, teams, TAB, titles and channels content.
module.packetAudit.census = Packet census
module.packetAudit.details = Contents
module.serverprobe.description = Collects everything the server reveals on its own: commands and their plugins, player tracking range, teleports, sound distance.
module.serverProbe.commands = Commands and plugins
module.serverProbe.tracking = Tracking range
module.serverProbe.teleports = Teleports
module.serverProbe.sounds = Sounds and particles
module.auctionscan.description = Pages through the auction and records every server item name. Feeds the name lookup for other players gear.
module.auctionScan.command = Open command
module.auctionScan.openSelf = Open by itself
module.auctionScan.categories = Walk categories
module.auctionScan.delay = Delay
module.auctionScan.delay.desc = Pause between page clicks
module.auctionScan.pageLimit = Page limit
module.auctionScan.pageLimit.desc = Maximum pages to walk
module.itemDebug.clickedSlots = Clicked slot
module.itemDebug.equipmentPackets = Equipment packets
module.itemDebug.containerPackets = Container packets
module.itemDebug.crosshairTarget = Crosshair target
module.itemDebug.nearbyPlayers = Nearby players
module.itemDebug.drops = Dropped items
module.itemDebug.chatSummary = Chat summary
module.itemDebug.toFile = Write to file
module.itemscroller.description = Moves items with the wheel and a held button. Unloading a chest takes a couple of motions.
module.itemusecontroller.description = Adjusts item use rules: delays, repeats, cancels. Fine control over how your hand behaves.
module.jumpcircle.description = Draws a circle under your feet when you jump. A small effect that visibly livens up movement.
module.menu.description = Settings for the menu itself: animations, speed, whether you can drag it. About how the GUI behaves, not the game.
module.milanafarm.description = Farms crops: harvests and replants. It loops until you stop it.
module.nameprotect.description = Hides nicknames, yours and other people's, behind replacements. Useful before recording or a screenshot.
module.noclip.description = Walks through walls: Grim starts treating wall blocks as air while nothing breaks server-side and regions stay untouched. Aim at the wall and walk.
module.ghostblock.description = Permanent ghost block via sequence collision: a block placement and a break-finish packet for the clicked block sharing one sequence — Grim registers the break prediction over the place one, orphaning it, so Grim keeps the block forever while the server never sees it. Works where the server denies placement (claims) — bounce on it endlessly. Costs one BadPacketsH alert per ghost, max 4 per 30 s, needs 60+ ms ping.
module.nodelay.description = Removes the delay after teleports and world changes. You move right away instead of standing frozen for a second.
module.nofrienddamage.description = Stops you from hitting friends and teammates. Aura and crystals leave them alone.
module.nointeract.description = Blocks accidental interactions: no opening a stranger's chest, no sitting in a boat mid-fight.
module.nopush.description = Stops players, mobs and water from pushing you around. You stay exactly where you stood.
module.noslow.description = Removes the slowdown from food, shields, potions and cobwebs. Eat and shoot at full speed.
module.nosweetslow.description = Cancels the slowdown from sweet berries and similar blocks. Bushes stop being a trap.
module.noweb.description = Walks through cobwebs like they are air. Web traps no longer hold you.
module.offhandmanager.description = Decides what sits in your offhand: totem, crystal or shield. It swaps by fight conditions instead of your memory.
module.openwals.description = Helps with base walls: highlighting and quick teardown. Built around server-side structures.
module.pathteleport.description = Teleports along a recorded route in short steps. Gets through where a plain teleport gets caught.
module.predictions.description = Shows where crystals, pearls and other projectiles will go. You see the outcome of a throw in advance.
module.pvpsafe.description = Keeps you out of accidental fights: blocks hits and risky actions outside combat. Saves you from your own misclicks.
module.reach.description = Slightly extends your attack range beyond vanilla. Works where the server does not hard-cap the distance.
module.rotationrecorder.description = Records your mouse rotations to a file that later feeds the rotation neural net training. Not something you need in a regular fight.
module.serverhelper.description = Small conveniences for specific servers: commands, auto replies, hints. Built from what people do by hand every day.
module.shaderesp.description = Shader-based ESP: smooth outlines and glow instead of boxes. Prettier and easier to read on any background.
module.shaderhand.description = Shades your hand and the item in it. A small thing that sets the mood of the whole first person view.
module.shulkerjump.description = Launches you upward with a shulker, high and damage-free. You gain a couple dozen blocks in one go.
module.shulkerpreview.description = Shows what is inside a shulker on hover. No need to place it down just to peek.
module.slimeflight.description = Flight on slime blocks: bounces add up into steady altitude. A cheap replacement for elytra.
module.speed.description = Speeds up your movement in several ways, from honest sprinting to tick-timed hops. Pick the mode that fits the server.
module.spider.description = Lets you climb walls like a spider. Sheer blocks stop being an obstacle.
module.srpspoof.description = Tells the server the resource pack is accepted without downloading it. Saves time and traffic on join.
module.strafe.description = Turns your movement with the camera and kills inertia. Sharp turns in the air and on ice.
module.streamermode.description = Hides everything sensitive on screen: nicknames, coordinates, server names. Turn it on before streaming and forget about it.
module.swinganimation.description = Changes the swing animation: speed, amplitude, style. Your hit looks the way you are used to.
module.tapemouse.description = Holds a mouse button down for you as long as needed. Easier on your hand, same result.
module.targetesp.description = Highlights the target you are hitting separately. In a brawl you always see who your target is.
module.targetpearl.description = Throws an ender pearl straight at the target, accounting for its movement. Catching runners becomes a single throw.
module.timer.description = Speeds up or slows down game time just for you. Powerful, but almost every anticheat notices it.
module.totemparticles.description = Custom particles on totem pop instead of vanilla ones. You notice the totem fired even out of the corner of your eye.
module.traptp.description = Teleports you to the target through a trap item once it is close enough. A quick way to close distance on anarchy servers.
module.tridentaimbot.description = Aims your trident at the target with flight and weather correction. Throw without looking, it lands.
module.triggerbot.description = Attacks by itself the moment a target lands under your crosshair. You aim, it clicks.
module.velocity.description = Cancels knockback from hits and explosions, fully or partially. They hit you and you stay put.
module.viafabricfix.description = Fixes ViaFabric compatibility when playing on older versions. Without it some packets go astray.
module.viewarmordurability.description = Shows armor and item durability right on screen. No digging into the inventory mid-fight.
module.viewmodel.description = Moves and rotates the item in your hand however you like. The classic first person view tweak.
module.wallbypass.description = Slips through walls where the server allows it. Not universal, but a lifesaver inside castles.
module.warpfarm.description = Farms warps and giveaways: arrives on time, grabs the drop and leaves before the pvp. Tunable per server.
module.worldtweaks.description = Small world tweaks: render distance, block animations, extra effects. About comfort and fps rather than beauty.
module.worldvisuals.description = Reworks how the world looks: lighting, saturation, sky and water colors. The picture becomes yours, not the server's.
module.worldweather.description = Sets your own weather and time of day on your screen. Eternal day or a storm, your pick.
module.xraybypass.description = Hides x-ray traces from server checks. You mine the same, the anticheat looks elsewhere.
quick.about = About
quick.about.commit = Build
quick.about.desc = Version, build number, role and playtime.
quick.about.role = Role
quick.about.version = Version
quick.blur = Background blur
quick.blur.desc = Blur of the world behind the menu. Zero turns it off and gives back a bit of fps.
